  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rlwend Womens Production Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used for trainings including financial management; cooperative management; and a business plan. While the focus is on capacity building funds will also be used to improve production by providing working capital for inputs; constructing a storage facility and conducting agricultural training.</narrative>
  </description>
